{
  "description": "16x16 pixel-art UI status icon for the Ready (task completed successfully) state of a queue. One bold, centered check mark with clearly asymmetrical arms: a short left arm meeting a much longer right arm that rises toward the upper right. Chunky 2-pixel-wide strokes, filled in a cool sky blue close to #70b9ed with one lighter blue highlight tone, crisp hard pixel edges, no anti-aliased blur, no stray pixels. Must read clearly at 1x and at 3x nearest-neighbor scale on a dark navy panel (#172336). Transparent background, no text, no circle or badge plate behind the mark, no drop shadow, single static image.",
  "width": 16,
  "height": 16,
  "no_background": true
}

{
  "version": 1,
  "scope": "Revised representative Ready status sample (queue.ready, second generation) under the refreshed contract: owner-required check mark with asymmetrical arms; later consumer destination assets/ready-confirmed.png. Only this candidate's own mechanical, meaning, check-mark, readability and accent-relationship checks are required at this stage, plus two scoped specialist sample criteria. Family distinction (Working/Retry/Paused vs Ready), the style-approval decision, placement at assets/ready-confirmed.png and renderer integration of statusCell/compactStatus are deferred later-stage obligations recorded with stage and prerequisites in rev2/request-review.json and PLAR, not rejection rules for this sample.",
