            {"path": "BRIEF.md", "locator": "Current update: keep ... review display conditions", "lines": [9, 9]},
            {"path": "src/queue-view.ts", "locator": "display scale 3, filter nearest, background #172336", "lines": [9, 9]}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cool-blue-accent",
          "domain": "visual",
          "mode": "visual",
          "check": "The dominant colour treatment visibly relates to the existing UI's cool blue accent as seen in assets/start.svg (#70b9ed). This is a visual relationship judgement, not an exact-hex or palette-count rule.",
          "basis": "Owner brief: use the existing UI's cool blue accent, no fixed palette required. #70b9ed is a consumer observation from the Start SVG fill, not an approved palette.",
          "scope": "This Ready candidate compared with the existing Start vector.",
          "authority": "requirement",
          "sources": [
            {"path": "BRIEF.md", "locator": "the existing UI's cool blue accent; a fixed palette is not required", "lines": [3, 3]},
            {"path": "assets/start.svg", "locator": "fill #70b9ed", "lines": [1, 1]}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "silhouette-without-color",
          "domain": "visual",
          "mode": "visual",
          "check": "In a grayscale/desaturated view at 1x and 3x, the Ready mark still has a distinct identifiable shape (its meaning is carried by form, not only hue).",
          "basis": "Specialist sample choice derived from the brief's non-colour distinction requirements for Retry and Paused: a sample whose identity is shape-carried keeps those later distinctions achievable. Checks only the Ready sample's own form; the pairwise family comparison is deferred.",
          "scope": "This Ready sample only (specialist sample criterion; caller may demote or drop).",
          "authority": "proposal",
          "sources": [
            {"path": "BRIEF.md", "locator": "Error/retry must be distinguishable without color alone", "lines": [3, 3]},
            {"path": "BRIEF.md", "locator": "Paused distinguishable without relying on color alone", "lines": [7, 7]}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sample-pixel-craft",
          "domain": "visual",
          "mode": "visual",
          "check": "As a representative family sample, the image shows deliberate pixel-art construction: clean pixel clusters and edges, no noisy stray pixels, blur or downscaled-illustration artifacts, and a treatment that could plausibly be extended to Working, Retry and Paused.",
          "basis": "Specialist expert judgment applying the brief's coherent pixel-art status assets and representative-sample instruction.",
          "scope": "This Ready sample, assessed for style review; passing does not approve the family style.",
          "authority": "proposal",
          "sources": [
            {"path": "BRIEF.md", "locator": "Create coherent pixel-art status assets", "lines": [3, 3]},
            {"path": "BRIEF.md", "locator": "propose a representative status sample before expanding the family", "lines": [5, 5]}
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

